---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure class="provider-map series-visual not-prose">
  <div class="harness">
    <p class="boundary">Coding Agent 的 harness 层 <span>局部展开</span></p>
    <div class="loop box">
      <strong>Agent Loop <span>Agent 循环</span></strong>
      <p>维护消息历史 · 调用工具 · 决定继续或停止</p>
    </div>
    <div class="exchange">
      <span>↓ 任务、历史、工具说明</span>
      <span>↑ 统一事件与完整回复</span>
    </div>
    <div class="provider">
      <div class="provider-title">
        <strong>模型接入</strong><span>provider</span>
      </div>
      <p class="configuration">
        按配置选择接入实现，准备服务地址、密钥和模型名称。
      </p>
      <div class="lanes">
        <div class="lane">
          <div class="function box">
            <span class="chapter">02 上 · 请求</span>
            <strong>请求转换</strong>
            <p>把消息、工具定义转换成服务接收的格式。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="direction">↓ 请求正文</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lane response">
          <div class="function box">
            <span class="chapter">02 下 · 响应</span>
            <strong>流式解析与回复组装</strong>
            <p>解析返回片段，拼接文字和工具请求，产出统一事件。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="direction">↑ 响应数据流</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="transport box">
        <strong>HTTP 通信</strong>
        <p>携带凭据发送请求、接收响应；处理连接错误、有限重试与中断。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="exchange remote-exchange">
    <span>↓ HTTP 请求</span><span>↑ 流式响应</span>
  </div>
  <div class="external">
    <p class="boundary">外部模型服务 <span>每次调用使用所选服务</span></p>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="service box">
        <strong>OpenAI</strong><span>Chat Completions API</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service box">
        <strong>Anthropic</strong><span>Messages API</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service box">
        <strong>Z.ai</strong><span>复用 Chat Completions 接入</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    图中按职责划分接入层内部功能，不代表一项功能对应一个文件。服务下方标的是本文涉及的接入路径，并非厂商支持的全部协议。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .provider-map {
    container-type: inline-size;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .provider-map p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .harness {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-secondary);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .boundary {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .boundary span {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .box {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-secondary);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .box strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .box p {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .loop {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .loop strong span {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .exchange {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--series-blue);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .exchange span:last-child {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .provider {
    padding: 0.9rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--series-blue);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .provider-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .provider-title strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .provider-title span {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .provider-map .configuration {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0.9rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .lanes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .lane {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .function {
    flex: 1;
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .chapter {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--series-blue);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .direction {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    color: var(--series-blue);
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .response .function {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .response .chapter,
  .response .direction {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .transport {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .external {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--series-feedback);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
  }
  .services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .service {
    text-align: center;
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .service span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .provider-map figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 460px) {
    .harness,
    .external {
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }
    .provider {
      padding: 0.65rem;
    }
    .lanes {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .function {
      padding: 0.6rem;
    }
    .services {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .service {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .service span {
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
